---
/* Two wide feature cards with CSS-drawn mock panels + six text cells,
   mirroring the plotted feature-grid rhythm of the reference layout. */
---

<section class="features" id="features">
  <div class="frame">
    <div class="grid-2">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="term">
            <p class="t-head">get_schedule · next 14 days</p>
            <p class="row"><span class="d">MON 20</span><span class="bar w40 o"></span>HW2 released</p>
            <p class="row"><span class="d">THU 23</span><span class="bar w55 b"></span>Quiz 3 closes 23:59</p>
            <p class="row"><span class="d">TUE 28</span><span class="bar w70 b"></span>Lab report due</p>
            <p class="row"><span class="d">FRI 31</span><span class="bar w30 r"></span>HW1 · final deadline</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>Deadline sweep</h3>
          <p>
            One call merges every due date, quiz close, and course event into a
            single timeline your agent can plan a study week around.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="term">
            <p class="t-head">journey · brief → draft</p>
            <p class="row ok">✓ get_assignment <span>brief + attachments</span></p>
            <p class="row ok">✓ fetch_file <span>hw1.pdf → markdown</span></p>
            <p class="row run">● agent <span>drafting answers</span></p>
            <p class="row idle">○ upload_file <span>draft.md</span></p>
            <p class="row idle">○ submit_assignment <span>finalize=false</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>Assignment autopilot</h3>
          <p>
            From brief to draft: read the assignment, convert the attached PDF,
            work the problems, upload, and submit a draft — then read it back
            to verify.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="cells grid-3">
      <div class="cell"><h3>Course map</h3><p>get_course_overview merges five endpoints into one markdown map, every ID and file URL embedded.</p></div>
      <div class="cell"><h3>PDF → markdown</h3><p>Assignment briefs become readable requirements — math, tables, and slides included.</p></div>
      <div class="cell"><h3>Grades &amp; feedback</h3><p>Cross-course summaries or every grade item of one course, weights and comments included.</p></div>
      <div class="cell"><h3>Forums &amp; messaging</h3><p>Catch up on announcement threads, then draft a message to your teacher — with confirmation.</p></div>
      <div class="cell"><h3>Escape hatch</h3><p>Opt in with MOODLE_ENABLE_WS_FUNCTION=true and call_ws_function reaches every other enabled web-service function your token can call.</p></div>
      <div class="cell"><h3>Version-adaptive</h3><p>Verified against Moodle 3.7, 4.5 and 5.2 — both ends of the range live-checked — with response differences absorbed for you.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features {
    max-width: calc(var(--frame-max) + 2px);
    margin: 96px auto 0;
  }

  .card {
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
  }

  .grid-2 .card:last-child {
    border-right: none;
  }

  .panel {
    margin: 22px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--night);
    padding: 18px;
  }

  .term {
    color: #aab0ba;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .t-head {
    color: #62676f;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .row {
    margin: 0 0 9px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .d {
    color: #7d838d;
    width: 52px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .bar {
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .w30 { width: 30%; } .w40 { width: 40%; }
  .w55 { width: 55%; } .w70 { width: 70%; }
  .o { background: #f2a541; } .b { background: #6366f1; } .r { background: #e05252; }

  .row span { color: #62676f; }

  .row.ok { color: #7fd99a; }
  .row.run { color: #f2c161; }
  .row.idle { color: #7d838d; }

  .card-body {
    padding: 4px 24px 26px;
  }

  .card-body h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .card-body p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    max-width: 400px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .grid-2 .card {
      border-right: none;
    }
  }
</style>
